text.en:
Section of the Decree is hereby amended to read as follows:
"Sec. 6. Duties of the Chairman. The Chairman shall perform the following duties:
(a) To call and preside over the meetings of the Board;
(b) To manage and administer the affairs of the Commission;
(c) To ensure that the decisions and policies of the Board are implemented;
(d) To sign for and represent the Commission;
(e) To accept on behalf of the Commission, gifts, grants, or donations and to administer and disburse the same
with the approval of the Board and in accordance with government rules, regulations and policies;
(f) To enter into and execute such contracts as may be deemed necessary in the pursuit of the Commission's
objectives, subject to the approval of the Board and in accordance with government rules, regulations and
(g) To organize permanent or ad-hoc committees, consisting of members of the Board or such other experts as
are deemed necessary for the discharge of the functions of the Commission."
